OL,3,GNEWSA'Tone deaf at best' - advice to
OL,4,Astock up on essentials worries experts
OL,5,Aand low-income families
OL,6,
OL,7,FA single mum has said following
OL,8,Fgovernment advice to stock up on
OL,9,Femergency supplies would mean
OL,10,Fsacrificing her childcare budget for
OL,11,Fthe school holidays.
OL,13,FSamantha Richards, who works full-time
OL,14,Fand relies on universal credit (UC) and
OL,15,Fher son's disability allowance to cover
OL,16,Fthe bills, said the call to prepare
OL,17,Freminded her of the "survival of the
OL,18,Ffittest".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
